  "title": "FOOTER STEMEdplus",
  "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"patternName\":\"twentytwentyfive/footer\",\"name\":\"Footer\",\"description\":\"Footer columns with logo, title, tagline and links.\",\"categories\":[\"footer\"]},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|contrast\"}}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"accent-4\",\"textColor\":\"contrast\",\"fontSize\":\"small\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"90%\",\"wideSize\":\"90%\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-contrast-color has-accent-4-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"},\"border\":{\"width\":\"0px\",\"style\":\"none\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|base\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"base\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-base-color has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:0px\"><strong>This site i</strong>s ADD DETAILS - see STEMEd+ Commons example.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"patternName\":\"twentytwentyfive/footer\",\"name\":\"Footer\",\"description\":\"Footer columns with logo, title, tagline and links.\",\"categories\":[\"footer\"]},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|base\"}}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#014704\"}},\"textColor\":\"base\",\"fontSize\":\"small\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"90%\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-base-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"background-color:#014704;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"},\"border\":{\"width\":\"0px\",\"style\":\"none\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:0px\"><strong>This site is part of <a href=\"https://stemedplus.org\">STEMEd+ Commons</a>, a Commons within Knowledge Commons. STEMEd+ Commons brings together STEM+ education communities to collectively build research insights and teaching innovations across disciplines. As an open access platform, STEMEd+ Commons helps ensure STEM+ education research and practice is accessible for all people, in all communities. This material is based upon work supported by the National Science Foundation under grants </strong><a href=\"https://www.nsf.gov/awardsearch/show-award/?AWD_ID=2226271\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">OAC-2226271</a><strong>, </strong><a href=\"https://www.nsf.gov/awardsearch/show-award/?AWD_ID=2321946\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DRL-2321946</a><strong>, </strong><a href=\"https://www.nsf.gov/awardsearch/show-award/?AWD_ID=2531819\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">OAC-2531819</a><strong>.</strong> and by Michigan State University through the <a href=\"https://research.msu.edu/find-funding/msu-funding-opportunities/jenison-support\">Jenison Fund</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
